      "quote": " -0800 (PST)\nDate: Wed, 19 Nov 2025 19:43:48 -0800\nMessage-ID: <CAGPM6VfrhrUAsFgkU8ukQnU4iF_7f_PjYH7912EHgtHHYzFnhw@mail.gmail.com>\nSubject: Tips for using your new inbox\nFrom: Gmail Team <mail-noreply@google.com>\nTo: World425 Law <world425.law@c-mercor.com>\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary=\"0000000000003600c00643fe8125\"\n\n--0000000000003600c00643fe8125\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=\"UTF-8\"\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\nTips for using your new inbox\n[image: Gmail]\n\nWelcome to your inbox\n[image: Search]\nFind emails fast\nWith the power of Google Search in your inbox, you can archive\n<https://support.google.com/mail/answer/6576?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwelc=\nomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\nall your email and find it\n<https://support.google.com/mail/answer/6593?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwelc=\nomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\nlater in a flash. Your inbox stays tidy, and you never need to worry about\nwhat to keep.\n[image: Personalize]\nPersonalize Mercor Mail\nCustomize inbox backgrounds, email signatures, and other options in Mercor\nMail settings\n<https://support.google.com/mail/answer/6562?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwelc=\nomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>.\nReview and adjust your privacy and security settings at My Account\n<https://myaccount.google.com/>.\n[image: Organize]\nOrganize your email\nYou can organize email with labels\n<https://support.google.com/mail/answer/118708?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwe=\nlcomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>,\nwhich are like folders, but you can add more than one label to a message.\nYou can also use filters\n<https://support.google.com/mail/answer/6579?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwelc=\nomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\nto automatically sort and categorize messages as they come in.\n[image: Social]\nChat and meet directly from your inbox\nMessage with contacts in Google Chat\n<https://support.google.com/chat/answer/9341104?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailw=\nelcomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\nand start video meetings with up to 100 people in Google Meet\n<https://support.google.com/mail/answer/9822902?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailw=\nelcomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\nall without leaving Gmail.\n\nGet training and tips\nFind Gmail guides, tips, cheat sheets, help switching from Microsoft=C2=AE\nOutlook=C2=AE, and more at the Google Workspace Learning Center\n<https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9259748?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgma=\nilwelcomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\n.\nVisit the Learning Center\n<https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9259748?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgma=\nilwelcomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome>\n\nHappy emailing,\nThe Gmail Team\n[image: Google Cloud]\n\n=C2=A9 2025 Google LLC 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043\n\n*You=E2=80=99re receiving this mandatory email service announcement to upda=\nte you\nabout important changes to your Google Cloud product or account.*\n\n--0000000000003600c00643fe8125\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=\"UTF-8\"\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta http-equiv=3D\"content-type\" content=3D\"tex=\nt/html;charset=3DUTF-8\"/><title>Tips for using your new inbox</title></head=\n><body style=3D\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;background-color:#f8f9fa; mar=\ngin:20px 0;\"><br/><div style=3D\"margin:2%;\"><div style=3D\"width:100%;margin=\n:0 auto 0 auto;\"><table style=3D\"vertical-align:middle;width:580px;margin:0=\n auto 0 auto;border:1px; border-color:black;\"><tr><td><img src=3D\"https://s=\nsl.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/rfr/logo_gmail_lockup_default_2x_r2.png\" sr=\ncset=3D\"https://ssl.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/rfr/logo_gmail_lockup_defa=\nult_1x_r2.png 1x, https://ssl.gstatic.com/ui/v1/icons/mail/rfr/logo_gmail_l=\nockup_default_2x_r2.png 2x\" alt=3D\"Gmail\" style=3D\"float:left;max-height:40=\npx;margin:0 20px 10px 20px;\"/></td></tr></table></div><div style=3D\"font-fa=\nmily:Roboto,'Open sans',Arial,sans-serif;color:#444; background-color:#fff;=\nmax-width:600px;margin:10px auto 0 auto;\"><table style=3D\"background:#fff;w=\nidth:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-color:#e8eaed; border-spacing:0;b=\norder-style:solid;border-width:1px;display:table; position:relative;\"><tr><=\ntd style=3D\"padding:5px 20px 0 20px;\"><div style=3D\"width:90%;padding-left:=\n15px;\"><p><span style=3D\"font-family:'Google sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-we=\night:700;line-height:32px; font-size:24px;\">Welcome to your inbox</span></p=\n></div><div style=3D\"float:left;clear:both;padding:10px 5px 10px 10px;\"><im=\ng src=3D\"https://ssl.gstatic.com/accounts/services/mail/msa/gmail-welcome-g=\nraphic1-2x.png\" srcset=3D\"https://ssl.gstatic.com/accounts/services/mail/ms=\na/gmail-welcome-graphic1-1x.png 1x, https://ssl.gstatic.com/accounts/servic=\nes/mail/msa/gmail-welcome-graphic1-2x.png 2x\" alt=3D\"Search\" style=3D\"displ=\nay:block;width:112px;height:auto;\"/></div><div style=3D\"float:left;vertical=\n-align:middle;padding:10px;max-width:398px;\"><table style=3D\"vertical-align=\n:middle;\"><tr><td style=3D\"font-family:Roboto,'Open sans',Arial,sans-serif;=\n\"><span style=3D\"color:#3c4043;font-family:'Google Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sa=\nns-serif; font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:20px;\">Find emails fas=\nt</span><br/><span style=3D\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto,Helvetica,Aria=\nl,sans-serif;font-size:14px; font-weight:400;line-height:24px;\">With the po=\nwer of Google Search in your inbox, you can <a href=3D\"https://support.goog=\nle.com/mail/answer/6576?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwelcomeemail&utm_medium=\n=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome\" style=3D\"text-decoration:none;color:#=\n15c;\">archive</a> all your email and <a href=3D\"https://support.google.com/=\nmail/answer/6593?hl=3Den&utm_source=3Dgmailwelcomeemail&utm_medium=3Demail&=\nutm_campaign=3Dgmailwelcome\" style=3D\"text-decoration:none;color:#15c;\">fin=\nd it</a> later in a flash. Your inbox stays tidy, and you never need to wor=\nry about what to keep.</span></td></tr></table></div><div style=3D\"float:le=\nft;clear:both;padding:10px 5px 10px 10px;\"><img src=3D\"https://ssl.gstatic.=\ncom/accounts/services/mail/msa/gmail-welcome-graphic2-2x.png\" srcset=3D\"htt=\nps://ssl.gstatic.com/accounts/services/mail/msa/gmail-welcome-graphic2-1x.p=\nng 1x, https://ssl.gstatic.com/accounts/services/mail/msa/gmail-welcome-gra=\nphic2-2x.png 2x\" alt=3D\"Personalize\" style=3D\"display:block;width:112px;hei=\nght:auto;\"/></div><div style=3D\"float:left;vertical-align:middle;padding:10=\npx;max-width:398px;\"><table style=3D\"vertical-align:middle;\"><tr><td style=\n=3D\"font-family:Roboto,'Open sans',Arial,sans-serif;\"><span style=3D\"color:=\n",
